{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は\nマネキンの幕張全握でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2013年初のイベだったよ〜\nあけおめー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新年早々\nめちゃくちゃたくさんのかたに\n来ていただけて本当にありがたい(*´｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつものレポですね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まずミニライブのセトリ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"指望遠鏡\n春のメロディー\n−自己紹介と抽選会−\n渋谷ブルース\nやさしさなら間に合ってる\n制服のマネキン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こないだの4th京都全握と違うのは\nWHITE HIGHによる\n『渋谷ブルース』も追加されたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Zeppと一緒のななみん、まいまいによる\n生のギター演奏も(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"抽選会では\nメンバーそれぞれが\n今年の豊富などなど書いた\n乃木神社の絵馬をプレゼント"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2013/01/05/8247298/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"当たった人おめでとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2013/01/05/8247298/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"福男！福女！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メインの握手"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2013/01/05/8247298/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"14レーン"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2013/01/05/8247298/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいたんと一緒のレーンでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも来てくださるかたも\n初めましてのかたも